name: JamlyzerSwipeBench
description: |
  Collect seeds with Motely CLI, then swipe them in Storybook Jamlyzer.

  From MotelyJAML (Release build):
    dotnet run --project Motely.CLI -c Release -- ^
      --jaml X:\jaml-ui\src\components\fixtures\jamlyzer-swipe.jaml ^
      --save-seeds --endBatch 500000

  --save-seeds writes the top hits into seeds: below. Re-open this file,
  refresh Storybook Jamlyzer, and swipe.

  Quick analyze-only check:
    dotnet run --project Motely.CLI -c Release -- ^
      --jaml X:\jaml-ui\src\components\fixtures\jamlyzer-swipe.jaml ^
      --analyze ALEEB,FROGMANS
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: WeeJoker
    antes: [1]
  - uncommonJoker: Any
    antes: [1]
should:
  - rareJoker: Any
    score: 3
